OL,3,GNEWSAStudent who raped woman and forced
OL,4,Aher to complete his assignments jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student who raped an undergraduate
OL,7,Fand forced her to complete his
OL,8,Funiversity assignments has been jailed
OL,9,Ffor six years.
OL,11,FThe High Court in Edinburgh heard how
OL,12,FZiyi Shi, 22, repeatedly subjected his
OL,13,Fvictim to sexual assaults and slapped
OL,14,Fher face and gripped her neck. When she
OL,15,Frefused to have sex with him or let him
OL,16,Fexamine her mobile phone, he bit her.
OL,18,FHe also made derogatory comments about
OL,19,Fthe woman and threatened to disclose
OL,20,Fpersonal information about her to the
OL,21,Fpublic.
